-         Space-to-be-distributed = 200px - borders = 200 - (1 + 1) - (1 + 1)
-                                 = 196px
-
-         1st element gets 5/8 of space: 5/8 * 196px = 122.5px
-         1st element gets 3/8 of space: 3/8 * 196px = 73.5px
